Let $\{ a_n \}$ and $\{ b_n \}$ be two sequences of real numbers defined by $a_1 = 20$, $b_1 = 23$, and for all positive integers $i$,
\[ \begin{cases}
a_{i+1} = \sqrt{|a_i \cdot b_i|} + \frac{a_i + b_i}{2} \\
b_{i+1} = \sqrt{|a_i \cdot b_i|} - \frac{a_i + b_i}{2}
