Given a square $ABCD$ with a point $P$ inside such that the distances from $P$ to the vertices $A$, $B$, and $C$ are $1$, $2$, and $3$ units, respectively. Determine the distance from $P$ to the remaining vertex $D$ and the side length of the square. [asy]
import math;
