   \]

4. Simplify the numerator:
   \[
   \text{Numerator}=\frac{2[x^{n-2}+2x^{n-3}+\cdots+(n-2)x+(n-1)]-(n-1)(x^{n-1}+x^{n-2}+\cdots+x+1)}{2(x^{n-1}+x^{n-2}+\cdots+x+1)}
