   \lim_{x \to 1}\dfrac{\frac{n}{1-x^n}-\frac{1}{1-x}-\frac{n-1}{2}}{x-1}
   =\frac{2\sum_{k=1}^{n-2}k(n-k-1)-(n-1)\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}k}{2n}
